{"lines": [{"text": "Why you should never ignore an error email. One cost four hundred sixty million dollars.", "start": 0.05, "end": 4.634, "spec": {"type": "hero"}, "words": [["Why", 0.086, 0.172], ["you", 0.172, 0.248], ["should", 0.259, 0.431], ["never", 0.431, 0.733], ["ignore", 0.733, 1.045], ["an", 1.045, 1.153], ["error", 1.228, 1.444], ["email", 1.455, 1.821], ["One", 2.177, 2.36], ["cost", 2.36, 2.651], ["four", 2.662, 2.888], ["hundred", 2.888, 3.071], ["sixty", 3.082, 3.47], ["million", 3.47, 3.739], ["dollars", 3.739, 4.256]]}, {"text": "In twenty twelve, Knight Capital was a giant of US stock trading.", "start": 4.714, "end": 8.506, "spec": {"type": "tower"}, "words": [["In", 0.075, 0.151], ["twenty", 0.162, 0.399], ["twelve", 0.399, 0.787], ["Knight", 0.991, 1.25], ["Capital", 1.261, 1.595], ["was", 1.681, 1.81], ["a", 1.81, 1.864], ["giant", 1.875, 2.328], ["of", 2.392, 2.468], ["US", 2.468, 2.856], ["stock", 2.856, 3.093], ["trading", 3.103, 3.459]]}, {"text": "But one of its eight servers missed a software update.", "start": 8.586, "end": 11.682, "spec": {"type": "servers"}, "words": [["But", 0.086, 0.205], ["one", 0.205, 0.334], ["of", 0.334, 0.388], ["its", 0.388, 0.496], ["eight", 0.614, 0.754], ["servers", 0.765, 1.336], ["missed", 1.562, 1.789], ["a", 1.8, 1.832], ["software", 1.832, 2.381], ["update", 2.381, 2.769]]}, {"text": "Before the market opened, it sent ninety-seven warning emails. Nobody acted.", "start": 11.762, "end": 16.154, "spec": {"type": "emails"}, "words": [["Before", 0.097, 0.302], ["the", 0.302, 0.345], ["market", 0.345, 0.614], ["opened", 0.614, 0.905], ["it", 1.25, 1.325], ["sent", 1.336, 1.595], ["ninety-seven", 1.606, 2.306], ["warning", 2.306, 2.565], ["emails", 2.565, 3.125], ["Nobody", 3.47, 3.75], ["acted", 3.75, 4.073]]}, {"text": "Then that server fired four million orders in forty-five minutes.", "start": 16.234, "end": 20.362, "spec": {"type": "orders", "cut": true}, "words": [["Then", 0.086, 0.334], ["that", 0.